{'symbol': 'FE', 'date': '2022-03-28 14:05:00', 'title': 'FIRSTENERGY PROMOTES ERNEST N. MALEY TO VICE PRESIDENT & CHIEF INFORMATION OFFICER', 'text': "DIGITAL ENABLEMENT AND STRONG CYBERSECURITY THE FOCUS FOR COMPANY'S IT DEPARTMENT AKRON, OHIO , MARCH 28, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- FIRSTENERGY CORP. (NYSE: FE) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ERNEST (ERNIE) N. MALEY HAS BEEN PROMOTED TO VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF INFORMATION OFFICER, EFFECTIVE APRIL 10, 2022."}